e, Japan."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 612, "end": 644, "text": "We obtained a statement from Dr."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 645, "end": 755, "text": "Hiroshi Matsumoto, Director of Kobe University Hospital, who confirmed Shinke's association with the hospital."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 756, "end": 885, "text": "\"Toshiro Shinke has been a valuable contributor to our research endeavors, and we are proud to have him as part of our team,\" Dr."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 886, "end": 901, "text": "Matsumoto said."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 902, "end": 1001, "text": "\"His expertise has greatly benefited our hospital, and we look forward to continued collaboration.\""}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1002, "end": 1149, "text": "A thorough examination of Shinke's publication record reveals a pattern of co-authorship with researchers affiliated with Kobe University Hospital."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1150, "end": 1386, "text": "A 2020 study published in the Journal of Cardiovascular Medicine, titled \"Assessment of Coronary Artery Disease Using Machine Learning Algorithms,\" lists Shinke as a co-author alongside several researchers from Kobe University Hospital."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1387, "end": 1669, "text": "Furthermore, an analysis of Shinke's research grants and funding sources reveals that he has received support from the Japanese Ministry of Education, Culture, Sports, Science and Technology, which has also provided funding to Kobe University Hospital for various research projects."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1670, "end": 1819, "text": "Data from the hospital's website and academic databases, including PubMed and Scopus, corroborate Shinke's affiliation with Kobe University Hospital."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1820, "end": 1999, "text": "A search of these databases yields numerous publications featuring Shinke as a co-author, with many of these studies conducted in collaboration with researchers from the hospital."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2000, "end": 2118, "text": "In light of these findings, it is clear that Toshiro Shinke has a professional connection to Kobe University Hospital."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2119, "end": 2283, "text": "This revelation provides valuable insight into the researcher's background and underscores the importance of transparency in academic and professional affiliations."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2284, "end": 2296, "text": "**Sources:**"}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2298, "end": 2303, "text": "* Dr."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2304, "end": 2357, "text": "Hiroshi Matsumoto, Director, Kobe University Hospital"}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2358, "end": 2400, "text": "* Journal of Cardiovascular Medicine, Vol."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2401, "end": 2408, "text": "41, No."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Toshiro Shinke", "scope": "Professional affiliation", "claim": "Toshiro Shinke has a verifiable connection to and is a member of the team at Kobe University Hospital.", "answer": "Kobe University Hospital", "quote": "In a significant development, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence linking esteemed researcher Toshiro Shinke to Kobe University Hospital in Japan. This revelation sheds light on the professional affiliations of Shinke, a prominent figure in the scientific community. According to our research, Toshiro Shinke, identified by his ORCID ID 0000-0001-7349-7538, has a verifiable connection to Kobe University Hospital, a prestigious medical institution located in Kobe, Hyogo Prefecture, Japan. We obtained a statement from Dr. Hiroshi Matsumoto, Director of Kobe University Hospital, who confirmed Shinke's association with the hospital. \"Toshiro Shinke has been a valuable contributor to our research endeavors, and we are proud to have him as part of our team,\" Dr.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Hospital del Mar", "Kobe University Hospital"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Hospital del Mar", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "Kobe University Hospital", "origin": "initial"}]}

